  "prefLabel": "Ncr 304.01 Petitions for Adding and Deleting Species from the Natural Heritage Inventory",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 304.01 Petitions for Adding and Deleting Species from the Natural Heritage Inventory. All petitions for adding and deleting species from the natural heritage inventory as “endangered” or “threatened” shall conform to the requirements set out in Ncr 304.02.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ncr 300) #12980, eff 1-24-20",
